  "notes": "# Rove 0.1.19\n\n- Compare recorded Assertion values side by side in Steps. Long text has a\n  compact preview, with navigation between differences or text matches and\n  separate copy controls for Expected and Actual.\n- Use Boolean expectations and the Matches regex condition. Object schema\n  checks can also set a minimum and maximum number of fields.\n- Folder creation and drag-and-drop organization save automatically. Open a\n  folder to rename it in place or press Command+S or Ctrl+S to save its settings.\n- Responses stay visible on Variables and Dataset and open on Body after Send.\n  An open Request remembers its selected Case until you close the Request tab.\n- Pasting cURL into the URL field reuses a matching host variable and offers a\n  choice when several variables match. Request fields highlight variable\n  references.\n- Create Case from Response keeps a consistent dialog size, and adding a JSON\n  response example opens it in a readable format.\n",
